[SPEAKER_04]: Endowed with these five things, Bhikkhu is unable to achieve right composure.

12
00:01:24,433 --> 00:01:25,414
[SPEAKER_04]: And then, it says the opposite.

13
00:01:25,514 --> 00:01:32,219
[SPEAKER_04]: When a Bhikkhu has khanti for sights, sounds, smells, tastes and touches, then he can achieve right composure.

14
00:01:35,681 --> 00:01:41,545
[SPEAKER_04]: So... Like, basically, we could see that

